     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 1 December 2021 The Project conducted an Inception workshop with participation of Deputy chairperson of State committee on Ecology and Nature Protection of the Republic of Uzbekistan, Deputy Minister of Finance of the Republic of Uzbekistan, UNDP Resident Representative and Global Manager of BIOFIN, as well as International organizations, donors, mass media, blogers and other participants from organizations involved in biodiversity activities. Gender balance of partiipants involved was 60% men and 40% women. Civil society organizations were represented by 4 entities involved. 
Project had consultations with colleagues from BIOFIN Kazakhstan and Kyrgizstan regarding their experience on hiring national and international consultants to work on policy and institutional reviews, biodiversity expenditures and financial solutions. Challanges project faced at inception phase mainly consist of head hunting for experts that have competence as in financial as well as in biodiversity. As per consultation with BIOFIN Global team, it is planned to involve experts in finance and further train them on BIOFIN implementation.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
